{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120972","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120972/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120972/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120972/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120972","id":4813305949,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHuU4XQ","number":120972,"title":"The default Android SDK in Godot can't be allowed in China's game store until user agree to Privacy Policy","user":{"login":"1ndexZero","id":155820151,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUmgdw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155820151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/1ndexZero","html_url":"https://github.com/1ndexZero","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1ndexZero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1ndexZero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1ndexZero/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1ndexZero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1ndexZero/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1ndexZero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1ndexZero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1ndexZero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1ndexZero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-05T15:00:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T09:25:11Z","closed_at":"2026-07-23T21:49:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot stable 4.6.3\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10, 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13450HX 2.40 GHz, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 6GB Laptop GPU\n\n### Issue description\n\n<img width=\"700\" height=\"377\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd113b86-51ab-46e3-963d-3ad738f4d477\" />\n\nIn China's game store TapTap, maybe also in others, **Android SDK permissions can't be allowed before user agree to Privacy Policy**, but Godot can't be allowed to set these default SDK, these SDK will launch before Privacy Policy showed in game.\n\nIf the problem can't be solved, it will seriously affect Godot's development in China.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nExport a blank Godot project for Android using the default export template.\n\nInstall the APK on an Android device and launch it.\n\nAfter Godot has fully launched and entered the main scene (i.e., after the  _ready()  function has executed), inspect the runtime permission status using Android's Privacy Dashboard or by running  adb shell dumpsys package [your.package.name] .\n\nObserve that despite the user never having clicked a \"Agree\" button, Godot's underlying services have already triggered permission requests or finalized SDK initialization during the splash screen/native startup phase.\n","closed_by":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120972/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120972/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}